{
  "name": "Catalog Sync Demo",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🤖 Catalog Sync Demo\n\nAutomatic catalog synchronization using AI.\n\n**Flow:**\n1. Supplier triggers webhook\n2. Fetch both catalogs in parallel\n3. AI detects name/price divergences\n4. Update marketplace automatically\n\n**Trigger:**\n```\nPOST /webhook/catalog-sync\n```",
        "height": 748,
        "width": 452,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "d08187d8-51c5-4da2-8ca5-912602b7aab6",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -192,
        -32
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📥 Data Collection\nFetches both catalogs **in parallel**.\n\n- 🏬 **Marketplace** → `localhost:8080/api/products`\n- 🏭 **Supplier** → `localhost:8081/api/products`",
        "height": 744,
        "width": 980,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "1c674430-64ca-4c2d-8fc2-824c14dfb391",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        304,
        -32
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🤖 AI Analysis\nThe LLM compares both lists and returns **only divergent products**.\n\n**Divergence rule:**\n- Name differs (case-insensitive)\n- Price differs by more than 0.01\n\nReturns: `{ \"updates\": [...] }`",
        "height": 744,
        "width": 736,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "c32eaa42-a791-4c49-9688-feeff053b64f",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1296,
        -32
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🔄 Sync Decision\n\n**IF** product has `marketplace_id`:\n- ✅ **True** → Update marketplace product\n- ⏭️ **False** → No changes needed, skip\n\nPrevents HTTP errors when AI returns empty updates.",
        "height": 744,
        "width": 588,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "fb1d41a1-54e2-4856-af56-2281be46a828",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2048,
        -32
      ]
    },
    {
